>
  <p>Toronto keeps a concrete crew busy. Century semis downtown sit on old foundations with porches and steps poured generations ago, postwar homes in Etobicoke and the old suburbs have driveways that have taken seventy winters of salt and freeze-thaw, and infill builds everywhere need new flatwork. <a href="/">Concrete Toronto</a> is a concrete contractor working across the whole city, and we back each job with a 2-year warranty.</p>

  <p>City lots come with city realities: tight side yards, laneway access, shared driveways and by-laws that govern driveway widths, curb cuts and sidewalks. Our contractors know Toronto's regulations and make sure your project complies with local requirements. If a permit or inspection applies to your job, we flag it before work starts, not after.</p>

  <h2>Concrete work in Toronto: what we do</h2>
  <p>Most of our Toronto calls fall into a few buckets:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-driveways/">Concrete driveways</a>, new pours and full replacements on a compacted base</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-patios/">Patios</a>, <a href="/services/concrete-walkways/">walkways</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-sidewalks/">sidewalks</a> that stay level through freeze-thaw</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-porches/">Porches</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-steps/">steps</a> repaired, resurfaced or rebuilt</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-foundations/">Foundations</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-slabs/">slabs</a> for garages, additions and commercial work</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-repair/">Repair</a>, <a href="/services/concrete-replacement/">replacement</a> and <a href="/services/parging/">parging</a>, plus waterproofing for foundations</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Every job starts with proper prep. We excavate to the right depth, compact a granular base, and pour a mix suited to our freeze-thaw climate. None of that is complicated, but prep is where cheap jobs cut corners, and it is why so much flatwork around the city fails early. Ours is built to stay put.</p>

  <h2>Residential and commercial</h2>
  <p>On the residential side, it is the concrete you live with every day: driveways, exterior steps and porches, backyard patios. On the commercial side, we pour foundations, parking spaces and sidewalks for Toronto businesses. Same crew, same standards, same 2-year warranty.</p>

  <h2>Why Toronto homeowners choose us</h2>
  <p>15 years of local experience and hundreds of concrete jobs across the city and surrounding areas. Straight answers about repair versus replacement, a written quote with no pressure, and a crew that shows up when we say we will and leaves the site clean.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>2-year warranty on every job</li>
    <li>Satisfaction guaranteed</li>
    <li>Free, no-obligation quotes</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Getting started is simple. Send a few photos and a short description through the form, and we follow the same clear <a href="/#process">six-step process</a> on every job. We also work right across the old suburbs in <a href="/locations/north-york/">North York</a> and <a href="/locations/scarborough/">Scarborough</a>, so one call covers family or rental properties across the city.</p>
